    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Thanksgiving for God’s Righteous Judgment"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "To the Chief Musician. Set to “Do Not Destroy.” A Psalm of Asaph. A Song."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We give thanks to You, O God, we give thanks!",
          "For Your wondrous works declare that Your name is near."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“When I choose the proper time,",
          "I will judge uprightly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The earth and all its inhabitants are dissolved;",
          "I set up its pillars firmly."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I said to the boastful, ‘Do not deal boastfully,’",
          "And to the wicked, ‘Do not lift up the horn."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Do not lift up your horn on high;",
          "Do not speak with a stiff neck.’ ”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For exaltation comes neither from the east",
          "Nor from the west nor from the south."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But God is the Judge:",
          "He puts down one,",
          "And exalts another."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For in the hand of the Lord there is a cup,",
          "And the wine is red;",
          "It is fully mixed, and He pours it out;",
          "Surely its dregs shall all the wicked of the earth",
          "Drain and drink down."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But I will declare forever,",
          "I will sing praises to the God of Jacob."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“All the horns of the wicked I will also cut off,",
          "But the horns of the righteous shall be exalted.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
